<section>
  <div class="prose-page">
    <div class="stack">
      <p class="eyebrow">Speaking</p>
      <h1 class="article__title">Speaker rider</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Everything you need to invite me to your event. Treat this as a starting
        point - tell me your constraints and we'll find something that works.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>What I speak about</h2>
      <p>
        Open source and digital sovereignty, community building, marketing automation
        with Mautic, accessibility, and living an active life with a disability. I give
        conference talks and keynotes, run practical workshops, and join panels - in
        person or online.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Fees</h2>
      <p>
        For community, non-profit and open source events I'll often speak for expenses
        only, or a reduced fee - keeping open knowledge open matters to me. For
        commercial and corporate events I charge a speaker fee. Tell me about your event
        and budget in the enquiry and we'll sort something fair.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Travel &amp; accommodation</h2>
      <p>
        I travel from Suffolk, England. For in-person events I ask the host to cover
        travel, and accommodation where an overnight stay is needed. I'm always glad to
        talk through options if budgets are tight.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Accessibility</h2>
      <p>
        I live with Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome, so a few things help me speak at my best.
        Please let me know what the venue can offer:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Step-free access to the room and the stage.</li>
        <li>A chair or high stool available on stage, and the option to sit.</li>
        <li>A clear run of show with breaks, and a little flexibility on timing.</li>
        <li>Somewhere quiet to rest before or between sessions.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Just ask - none of this is a barrier to a great session, and I'm happy to talk it through.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Tech &amp; AV</h2>
      <p>
        I present from my own laptop (USB-C / HDMI - please have adapters to hand) with
        16:9 slides. I'll need a projector or screen, audio if a talk includes video, and
        a microphone (handheld or lapel). For online events I'm comfortable with the usual
        platforms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Bio &amp; headshots</h2>
      <p>
        Short and long bios and print-ready headshots are available on request - mention
        it in your enquiry and I'll send them over.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="cluster">
      {{ button("Invite me to speak", "/speaking/book/", "primary") }}
      {{ button("Back to speaking", "/speaking/", "secondary") }}
    </div>
  </div>
